   "text": "Manchester Metropolitan University International College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nManchester Metropolitan University International College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe International College is a part of Manchester Metropolitan University, providing pathway courses to help international students get ready to study undergraduate and masters degrees. \nThe curriculum complements the University’s teaching and commitment to high-quality learning. \nStudents can choose from courses at Foundation, International Year One and Pre-Masters levels.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:06\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 09:07\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £21,500.00\nMin: £11,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n11%\n2,850 of 27,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1970\nCampus(es)\nManchester\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.mmu.ac.uk/international/college/admissions/accommodation\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.mmu.ac.uk/international/college/admissions/scholarships\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B5SPdjGP8Lg\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
